{"id":"9cac5018c941051e","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md","title":"FS的capture与release规则","display":"thm-FS-necessity-adequacy — FS的capture与release规则","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy","aliases":["91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy","91-thm-FS-modal-truth","91-thm-FS-box-axiom"],"display":"thm-FS-necessity-adequacy — FS的capture与release规则","depends_on":["[[91-df-FS]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy</span><span>91-thm-FS-modal-truth</span><span>91-thm-FS-box-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-FS-necessity-adequacy — FS的capture与release规则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-FS-necessity-adequacy-—-FS-的-capture-与-release-规则\">thm-FS-necessity-adequacy — FS 的 capture 与 release 规则</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> (标准 Friedman–Sheard 理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}\\)</span> (FS 的 capture 与 release 规则集,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (FS 语言句子集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这两行是关于定理闭包的元规则，不是对象语言中的条件句\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\varphi\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 和\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi\\)</span>，更不是单个全局公式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(x)\\to T(x))\">\\(\\forall x(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(x)\\to T(x))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>capture 可反复应用于已得到的定理，故从\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 可继续得到嵌套真理\n定理；这仍是规则迭代。把规则内化为全局反思需要额外的句法表示与\n反思定理，不能由规则名称直接推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-FS-necessity-adequacy-—-FS-的-capture-与-release-规则","text":"thm-FS-necessity-adequacy — FS 的 capture 与 release 规则","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}$ (FS 的 capture 与 release 规则集,\nsee [[91-df-FS]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FS}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}FS\\text{-}necessity\\text{-}adequacy}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi\\to T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{FS}}(x)\\to T(x))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}\\vdash T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false}],"bytes":1527,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[